<title>AUSTRALIA: CRICKET-AUSTRALIA 434 FOR FIVE AT STUMPS V WEST INDIES.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-AUSTRALIA 434 FOR FIVE AT STUMPS V WEST INDIES.</headline>
<dateline>ADELAIDE 1997-01-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Australia were 434 for five at close of play on the second day of their fourth test match against the West Indies at the Adelaide Oval on Sunday.</p>
<p>Scores:</p>
<p>Australia - 434 for five from 130 overs (Overnight 139 for two) - (Matthew Hayden 125, Mark Waugh 82, Greg Blewett 91 not out).</p>
<p>West Indies first innings - 130 in 47.5 overs (Michael Bevan four for 31, Shane Warne three for 42.)</p>
